  (polyline (pts (xy 248.00 220.00) (xy 408.00 220.00) (xy 408.00 258.00) (xy 248.00 258.00) (xy 248.00 220.00)) (stroke (width 0.3) (type default)) (uuid "bd48f88a-6753-58d1-bbfc-ef806e7f80d9"))
  (text "(1) The general 24 V rail is 2.5 mm2. The S200 24 V feed is 1.0 mm2. There is no 48 V rail.\n(2) G2 is an open 24 V slot. SDR-480-24 is the slot size, not a purchase.\n(3) Both 0 V rails meet at X1 pin 4. W1 is the only bond to PE. Confirm W1 in the S200 PTI manual.\n(4) F14 is 6 A on the S200 rail. F24 is 20 A on the general rail.\nNets that leave this sheet are listed on the notes sheet." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 249.60 221.40 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e6dfa080-e772-58ae-8738-d2b19addaf4b"))
